<title>UK: EIB sets 500 mln French franc step-up bond.</title>
<headline>EIB sets 500 mln French franc step-up bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-05-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Societe Genrale.</p>
<p> BORROWER   EUROPEAN INVESTMENT BANK</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN FFR   COUPON   **5.105     MATURITY  **13.JUN.07</p>
<p> TYPE   STEP-UP	 ISS PRICE  PAR	 PAY DATE    13.JUN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  0.325     REOFFER    PAR	 SPREAD	=</p>
<p> DENOMS (K) 100-1M    LISTING    PAR/LUX   PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES    **STEPS UP TO 6.70 PCT 13.JUN.02 IF NOT CALL AT PAR</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
